-- first_layer_32out_bn_relu_resource_shared_pkg.vhd
-- VHDL-2008 package for the RESOURCE-SHARED (time-multiplexed) folded
-- Conv-BN-ReLU prototype covering kernels 0-31 of enc1.block.0.weight.
